{"data": [{"author_id": "2001574449322295296", "created_at": "2026-10-26T23:39:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114864439111688416"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/DrGunerSonmez/…", "end": 165, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/DrGunerSonmez/status/2114736019748905138", "start": 142, "url": "https://t.co/zNFlvxmpOi"}]}, "id": "2114864439111688416", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114736019748905138", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Bu satırları okurken aklımdaki tek soru ne zaman; prime editing masadaki araçlardan biri olduktan sonra o tarih takvime giriyor gibi duruyor. https://t.co/zNFlvxmpOi", "url": "https://x.com/EmilyBunya77439/status/2114864439111688416"}, {"author_id": "1041829807011627009", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:01:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114824847750742276"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 252, "start": 245, "tag": "CRISPR"}, {"end": 266, "start": 253, "tag": "AIforScience"}], "urls": [{"description": "Silvana Konermann on AI People Wiki: Co-founder, Executive Director and Core Investigator, leading the Konermann Lab at Arc Institute. Studied at Stanford.…", "display_url": "aipeoplewiki.com/people/silvana…", "end": 243, "expanded_url": "https://aipeoplewiki.com/people/silvana-konermann/", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114824853928992768/q-jAACC8?format=png&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114824853928992768/q-jAACC8?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 220, "status": 200, "title": "Silvana Konermann at Arc Institute: wiki profile | AI People Wiki", "unwound_url": "https://aipeoplewiki.com/people/silvana-konermann/", "url": "https://t.co/kyid6ymMH2"}]}, "id": "2114824847750742276", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 36, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Spotlight on Silvana Konermann, co-founder and Executive Director of Arc Institute and a Stanford biochemistry professor. Her lab builds CRISPR tools for engineering RNA to study Alzheimer's and other brain diseases. 🧬\n\nhttps://t.co/kyid6ymMH2\n\n#CRISPR #AIforScience", "url": "https://x.com/Shadowfetch/status/2114824847750742276"}, {"author_id": "1580408538119417856", "created_at": "2026-10-26T22:36:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114848774984204688"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "A single-dose AAV-CRISPR therapy restores dystrophin in humanized DMD mice and achieves durable editing with manageable safety in non-human primates. In a first-in-human DMD trial, the therapy yields molecular evidence of muscle editing but reveals a fatal dose-dependent immune complication, highlighting the urgent need to expand the safety margin of systemic AAV-CRISPR treatments.", "display_url": "cell.com/cell/fulltext/…", "end": 172, "expanded_url": "https://www.cell.com/cell/fulltext/S0092-8674(26)01206-7", "images": [{"height": 375, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114840087640887297/yUMIDkDW?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 375}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114840087640887297/yUMIDkDW?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 149, "status": 200, "title": "In vivo genome-editing therapy for Duchenne muscular dystrophy: Preclinical studies and first-in-human trial", "unwound_url": "https://www.cell.com/cell/abstract/S0092-8674(26)01206-7", "url": "https://t.co/mHzwQU9Au0"}]}, "id": "2114848774984204688", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 620, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "Duchenne型筋ジストロフィーに対する単回AAV-CRISPR治療が、前臨床でdystrophin発現を回復し、初のヒト試験でも筋でゲノム編集を確認した一方、用量依存的な致死性免疫合併症が生じ、全身AAV-CRISPR治療の安全域拡大が課題であることを示した論文がCell誌に発表されました。\nhttps://t.co/mHzwQU9Au0", "url": "https://x.com/iPatho1/status/2114848774984204688"}, {"author_id": "1900249220919197696", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:36:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114833479007666381"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/BlondHimboBoyy…", "end": 76, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/BlondHimboBoyy/status/2114479499316207978", "start": 53, "url": "https://t.co/O4lXWmFsjF"}]}, "id": "2114833479007666381", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 34, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114479499316207978", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "this doesn't even make any sense is your dick crispr https://t.co/O4lXWmFsjF", "url": "https://x.com/starrypastellar/status/2114833479007666381"}, {"author_id": "2856326414", "created_at": "2026-10-26T23:07:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114856464619622810"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 225, "id": "27900939", "start": 214, "username": "AstellasUS"}]}, "id": "2114856464619622810", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 65, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The paper demonstrates in vivo CRISPR editing in human muscle, but with only four patients, no established clinical benefit, and one treatment-related death, it raises the same systemic AAV safety concerns seen in @AstellasUS' failed gene therapy program in 2023.\n\nPermanent", "url": "https://x.com/DUNQU1/status/2114856464619622810"}, {"author_id": "1718733072462700544", "created_at": "2026-10-26T22:18:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114844255068062156"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 92, "id": "10228272", "start": 84, "username": "YouTube"}], "urls": [{"description": "When Feng Zhang was in his early 30s, he used a set of genes found ...", "display_url": "youtu.be/_UimlaolxiA?is…", "end": 79, "expanded_url": "https://youtu.be/_UimlaolxiA?is=mf1zNfsZ6F9Puabn", "images": [{"height": 720, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112497263109107